{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an artbook for the timeloop RPG In Stars and Time! Includes 162 pages of concept art and wips and lil character facts!!! Wow!!!!!!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(The artbook contains spoilers, so finishing In Stars and Time is recommended.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2728 To find the artbook when you've bought it, find </strong>In Stars and Time<strong> in your Steam Library, right click, go to Local Files, Browse, and you should find the PDF there! \u2728 </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you still can't find it, you might need to change the game's language. Go to your Steam Library, right click the game, and change the game's language to English, and the artbook should now be in your Local Files. You can revert the language then!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588130?t=1743767482","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588130?t=1743767482","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588130/86808efedf3ad51eff6d67157c02e7ff2a93a33a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743767482","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588130/86808efedf3ad51eff6d67157c02e7ff2a93a33a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743767482","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an artbook for the timeloop RPG In Stars and Time! Includes 162 pages of concept art and wips and lil character facts!!! Wow!!!!!!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </